      {
        "id": "thinking-configuration",
        "verifiedOn": "2026-08-09",
        "claim": "Claude Opus 5 和 Sonnet 5 默认启用 thinking；两者接受 adaptive，且是否可以禁用 thinking 由特定模型的规则决定。",
        "sourceUrl": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/thinking"
      },
      {
        "id": "effort-control",
        "verifiedOn": "2026-08-09",
        "claim": "Claude Sonnet 5 支持 low 和 high effort，Claude Opus 5 支持 medium effort，并且 effort 是一种行为信号，而不是严格的 Token 预算。",
        "sourceUrl": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/effort"
      },
      {
        "id": "fast-mode",
        "verifiedOn": "2026-08-09",
